  {
   "id": "a02-text-20",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 690,
   "width": 657,
   "height": 85,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 158380,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2094580,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. SPF gives the primary next hop E for D (A1).\n2. For every other neighbor N (skip excluded ones, B6), test check 1.\n3. Mark the passing ones downstream / node-protecting.\n4. Pick the best one (B7) and install it as the backup next hop.",
   "originalText": "1. SPF gives the primary next hop E for D (A1).\n2. For every other neighbor N (skip excluded ones, B6), test check 1.\n3. Mark the passing ones downstream / node-protecting.\n4. Pick the best one (B7) and install it as the backup next hop.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
